<slide>
  <style>
    <fill>
      <fillColor color="linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,23,42,1) 0%,rgba(30,41,59,1) 100%)"/>
    </fill>
  </style>
  <data>
    <!-- 顶部装饰线 -->
    <line startX="0" startY="0" endX="960" endY="0">
      <border color="rgba(0,212,255,0.8)" width="3"/>
    </line>

    <!-- 标题 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="45" topLeftY="35" width="700" height="40">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" textAlign="left" bold="true">
        <p>后台识别与实时界面反馈</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 副标题 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="45" topLeftY="78" width="700" height="25">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(0,212,255,1)" textAlign="left">
        <p>耗时识别放在后台，主线程负责交互和显示</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 左侧 - 主线程 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="45" topLeftY="130" width="380" height="220" presetHandlers="8">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(0,212,255,0.1)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgba(0,212,255,0.4)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="65" topLeftY="145" width="200" height="28">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(0,212,255,1)" textAlign="left" bold="true">
        <p>主线程</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="65" topLeftY="180" width="340" height="30">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" textAlign="left">
        <p>MainWindow / CameraView</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="65" topLeftY="225" width="340" height="110">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(203,213,225,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8">
        <p>启动 / 暂停 / 停止控制</p>
        <p>页面与按钮响应</p>
        <p>画面、次数、进度渲染</p>
        <p>错误提示与动画</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 中间通信箭头 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="440" topLeftY="220" width="80" height="30">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(0,212,255,1)" textAlign="center" bold="true">
        <p>Qt 信号</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="425" startY="260" endX="535" endY="260">
      <border color="rgba(0,212,255,0.7)" width="2"/>
      <endArrow type="arrow"/>
    </line>
    <line startX="535" startY="280" endX="425" endY="280">
      <border color="rgba(0,212,255,0.4)" width="2"/>
      <endArrow type="arrow"/>
    </line>

    <!-- 右侧 - 识别线程 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="535" topLeftY="130" width="380" height="220" presetHandlers="8">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(251,191,36,0.1)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgba(251,191,36,0.4)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="555" topLeftY="145" width="200" height="28">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(251,191,36,1)" textAlign="left" bold="true">
        <p>识别线程</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="555" topLeftY="180" width="340" height="30">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" textAlign="left">
        <p>MotionWorker</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="555" topLeftY="225" width="340" height="110">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(203,213,225,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8">
        <p>视频读取 → 推理 → 平滑 → 计数</p>
        <p>发送画面、次数、有效性</p>
        <p>原子标志控制暂停/停止</p>
        <p>发送错误信号</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 底部说明卡片 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="45" topLeftY="380" width="870" height="90" presetHandlers="8">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(51,65,85,0.5)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgba(0,212,255,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="65" topLeftY="395" width="830" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(203,213,225,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p>framePending 原子标志限制待显示帧，避免预览事件积压；QImage.copy() 保证数据独立</p>
        <p>暂停：摄像头模式继续预览识别停止；测试视频模式停止推进</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 页脚 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="45" topLeftY="505" width="100" height="20">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left">
        <p>WakeAI</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="820" topLeftY="505" width="95" height="20">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="right">
        <p>11 / 15</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>建议用时 55 秒。MotionWorker 迁移到 QThread，后台读取、推理、平滑、计数，以信号发送结果。原子标志控制暂停停止及待显示帧。framePending 限制积压，QImage copy 保证数据独立。摄像头暂停识别时仍预览，视频暂停则停止推进。</p>
      <p>内容依据：用户提供的制作大纲及静态代码分析。未独立运行程序。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
</slide>